{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_review_remaining_questions_overview", "label": "The Questions Still Open (round two, R1-R19)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/review/remaining-questions.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Second, shorter round compiled from AMPM's eleven items to confirm, two developer points, and open points recorded while applying the 25 October answers; nine need a real decision, ten need only a tick."}, {"id": "docs_review_remaining_questions_r1", "label": "R1 - Demo: duration, locations, hotels", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/review/remaining-questions.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Decided 26 Oct 2026: no time limit, three locations, one real hotel each with indicative prices, admin-managed; invented samples would need six hotel pages, everything else is a setting."}, {"id": "docs_review_remaining_questions_r2", "label": "R2 - Payment gateway", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/review/remaining-questions.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Decided 26 Oct 2026: Razorpay; merchant account takes 1-2 weeks and must be in AMPM's name; PayU/Cashfree fit the same adapter."}, {"id": "docs_review_remaining_questions_r3", "label": "R3 - Cancellation and refunds", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/review/remaining-questions.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Decided 26 Oct 2026: no refund offered; the portal must state a rule at payment and Finance needs a button or rule; raised from finding GP-7, on no prior list."}, {"id": "docs_review_remaining_questions_r4", "label": "R4 - Client portals on the web as well as the apps", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/review/remaining-questions.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Decided 26 Oct 2026: apps plus web for clients, built from shared client-app code; the largest open cost item; team app stays native for offline use."}, {"id": "docs_review_remaining_questions_r5", "label": "R5 - Two accounts or one shared login", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/review/remaining-questions.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Working decision 26 Oct 2026: two individually authenticated accounts (the brief's preference) resolving the shared-vs-separate conflict; gives a per-person audit trail; to be countersigned."}, {"id": "docs_review_remaining_questions_r6", "label": "R6 - One approval or both representatives", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/review/remaining-questions.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Open: one approval proposed for the first release, configurable to require both for budgets and contracts; two approvals add a waiting state and reminder."}, {"id": "docs_review_remaining_questions_r7", "label": "R7 - Which amounts the client sees", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/review/remaining-questions.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Open: Level 2 proposed (planned/approved amounts per function, client invoices, payment status); never vendor quotes, internal cost or margin."}, {"id": "docs_review_remaining_questions_r8", "label": "R8 - Which hotel services carry a fee", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/review/remaining-questions.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Open: availability checks included; negotiation, site visits, contract review and booking assistance proposed to need an accepted service agreement first."}, {"id": "docs_review_remaining_questions_r9", "label": "R9 - Staff roles and cost visibility", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/review/remaining-questions.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Open: confirm nine staff roles and who may see hotel and vendor costs; cost visibility restricted to specifically authorised personnel."}, {"id": "docs_review_remaining_questions_r10", "label": "R10 - How staff sign in", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/review/remaining-questions.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Decided 26 Oct 2026: password plus authenticator-app code, identity service Amazon Cognito in Mumbai; the code works without signal inside a venue."}, {"id": "docs_review_remaining_questions_r11", "label": "R11 - RSVP link structure", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/review/remaining-questions.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Open: per-side links proposed as standard with a combined link option, both in the first release since they share one mechanism; household links where contacts exist."}, {"id": "docs_review_remaining_questions_r12", "label": "R12 - Retention periods and privacy wording", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/review/remaining-questions.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Open: proposed retention (leads 24m, guest records 12m after closure, identity docs 30 days after checkout) with Super Admin approval; notices to the DPDP Act 2023; merges Q8 and Q17."}, {"id": "docs_review_remaining_questions_r13", "label": "R13 - Hosting, backups and recovery", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/review/remaining-questions.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Decided 26 Oct 2026: AMPM dedicated VPS (Hostinger KVM 4, Mumbai), pgBackRest to a Mumbai S3 bucket, rehearsed monthly restores; accounts and source code in AMPM's name."}, {"id": "docs_review_remaining_questions_r14", "label": "R14 - Capacity: staff, weddings, guests, hotels", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/review/remaining-questions.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Open: confirm staff and largest guest counts; drafts rescaled to 200 hotels and 20 concurrent weddings; larger numbers change indexing and storage, not the design."}, {"id": "docs_review_remaining_questions_r15", "label": "R15 - WhatsApp, SMS and email providers", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/review/remaining-questions.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Open: developer proposed to select providers with AMPM owning the accounts; SMS is a launch dependency because clients sign in by OTP; WhatsApp and DLT onboarding take 2-6 weeks."}, {"id": "docs_review_remaining_questions_r16", "label": "R16 - Service levels, support and on-call", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/review/remaining-questions.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Open: proposed 99.5% monthly availability, on-call cover on wedding days, no deployments while a wedding is live; drives the maintenance contract; arose from architecture assumptions T-12 and T-14."}, {"id": "docs_review_remaining_questions_r17", "label": "R17 - One go-live or hotel discovery first", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/review/remaining-questions.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Decided 26 Oct 2026: the whole first release goes live at once; shapes the schedule and cost estimate more than any other open point."}, {"id": "docs_review_remaining_questions_r18", "label": "R18 - Material-change thresholds and approval", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/review/remaining-questions.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Open: proposed material-change thresholds (10% on a budget line or 5% of total, any date or venue change) with a second approver above 15% of the total budget."}, {"id": "docs_review_remaining_questions_r19", "label": "R19 - Archiving and reopening a wedding", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/review/remaining-questions.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Open: Project Manager proposes archiving and Super Admin approves; reopening read-only for 30 days with a logged reason; nothing deleted; completes the settled post-wedding policy."}, {"id": "docs_review_remaining_questions_group_1_demo_payment_refunds", "label": "Group 1 - Getting in: the demo, payment and refunds", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/review/remaining-questions.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_review_remaining_questions_group_2_the_client_side", "label": "Group 2 - The client side", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/review/remaining-questions.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_review_remaining_questions_group_3_your_team", "label": "Group 3 - Your team", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/review/remaining-questions.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null